  "source_interpretation_caveats": [
    "The source variable/column log2_tpm denotes generated L=log2(TPM+1), because X=2^L-1; original source column names are retained.",
    "The amplitude DGP scales X+1, not exactly X: X_ij+1=2^(b_j)*2^(0.20*a_i). Every within-sample gene ordering is constant across samples by design.",
    "The strong-expression budget is 2000 but only 220 genes exist; all 30 outer fits per scenario use 220 genes, while matched arms use 200.",
    "The predefined-pair scenario intentionally places the response in an ordering of two lower-variance genes. MAD excludes both drivers in all 30 outer candidate sets; response-associated selection includes both in all 30. This is a designed selector stress case, not a general causal decomposition.",
    "The pure-tissue scenario has exact within-tissue outcome constancy; recorded OOF tissue mean predictions have floating-point RMSE up to 1.962615573354719e-17, and Spearman is not exactly one in every cohort. Do not silently round all rank statistics to one.",
    "267 fit-warning occurrences (89 for each of three continuous-expression arms) occur in the common-amplitude scenario; no fallback or task omission is recorded. Warning types cannot be resolved from aggregates alone and are not asserted here.",
    "The synthetic execution lock and run metadata do not contain a separate actual-runtime package-version snapshot. Source commit and hashes are verified; pinned repository requirements are not proof of the actual run environment.",
    "The model configuration inherits descriptive strings about real-drug cohorts and statistics, but the synthetic launcher overrides task construction, synthetic gene identifiers, 3x1 outer design, seeds and DGP inputs. The inherited text is not evidence of real-data access.",
    "Current audit reads only source/configuration, aggregate CSVs, execution metadata and filenames. It reconciles published checkpoint-hash maps and confirms file existence but does not newly open/revalidate checkpoint payloads or individual predictions. Original analyzer records all 960 checkpoint hashes verified."
  ],
